    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRAXION</strong> is a retro-style cave flyer featuring beautiful pixel art, great music, and tons of physics-based puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you are being sent on a dangerous mission in outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly your ship through the underground caves of four different alien planets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the valuable Klystron pods, and tow them back to the surface using your ships tractor beam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware! Alien patrol ships are out to get you, and many traps and surprises await.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRAXION</strong> is a retro-style cave flyer featuring beautiful pixel art, great music, and tons of physics-based puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you are being sent on a dangerous mission in outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly your ship through the underground caves of four different alien planets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the valuable Klystron pods, and tow them back to the surface using your ships tractor beam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware! Alien patrol ships are out to get you, and many traps and surprises await.</p>",
